{"product_id":"vaporesso-luxe-qs-pod-system","title":"Vaporesso Luxe QS Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out Vaporesso LUXE QS Pod System, featuring an integrated 1000mAh battery, Luxe Q pod compatibility, and leak resistant SSS Technology.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-luxe-q-replacement-pods\" title=\"Vaporesso Luxe Q Pods\"\u003eVaporesso LUXE Q Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from durable zinc-alloy, the chassis of the LUXE QS Pod System offers a strong and protective enclosure around the large capacious battery. Adopting Luxe Q Pods, the Vaporesso LUXE QS, possesses two airflow options that can be selected by rotating the pod before insertion. Holding up to 2mL of eJuice within the refillable pod, the Vaporesso Luxe QS Starter Kit utilizes a 1000mAh integrated battery to deliver plenty of power throughout the day.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVaporesso LUXE QS Pod System Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 91.9mm by 26mm by 16.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1000mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.6-1.0ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eE-Juice Viewing Window\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Airflow - Rotate To Change\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Mouthpiece Cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSSS Leak-Resistant Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 0.8ohm Mesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1.2ohm Mesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C USB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Vaporesso Luxe QS Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.6ohm Luxe Q Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.0ohm Luxe Q Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Warranty Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Reminder Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41876291616823,"sku":"V Luxe QS Pod System","price":4900.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_-_luxe_qs_-_pod_kit_-_black.webp?v=1757894503","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-luxe-qs-pod-system","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




